MapMod_Block::LoadChunk  ('bloc')

Canonical shape of every MapMod_*_LoadChunk:
  chunk = packFile->vtbl[88](packFile, FOURCC, 0, 0);   // find/lock chunk
  if (chunk) {
      map->vtbl[160](map, FOURCC, 0, &g_<Fmt>FieldDefs, chunk);  // import via field table
      packFile->vtbl[96](packFile, FOURCC);              // unlock chunk
  }
  return 1;
The 4th argument is the static field-definition table describing the on-disk layout
of that chunk, which drives the generic pack-file deserializer.

